		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a265b7f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="a265b7f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-acce3f7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="acce3f7" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-style: normal; text-align: left;"><strong>Let it rain and create an effect that’s anything but standard</strong></p><p>Imagine falling raindrops indoors – guided invisibly – creating an overall appearance of fresh, clean rain. This is exactly what our rain curtain water features  provide. Attractive and intriguing, a rain curtain <a href="/waterwalls/">water wall</a> could be just what your space requires. With Midwest Tropical, you can have a custom-designed indoor rain water curtain installed in your facility or home, adding the visual interest you want. While these features are often considered best for tall spaces, our nearly 40 years of building <a href="/specialty-features/">custom water features</a> have taught us how to control the waterfall effect so they can fit in virtually any interior design, no matter what the ceiling height is. </p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-fc187d4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="fc187d4" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-60d72a4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="60d72a4" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Whether you have a tall lobby space or a cozy waiting room, you can enjoy the benefits and look of a custom rain curtain designed to fit your space precisely. To give you a better idea of what that means, here are some of the sizes we offer, ideal for different settings: 8 feet wide by 12 feet high; 20 feet wide by 10 feet high; and 15 feet wide by 24 feet high. We have created every type of indoor water curtain you can imagine. We have installed these features everywhere from offices, hotels, hospital lobbies, and restaurants, casinos, high-end homes and more. Whether you are looking for a standalone option, such as a circular or curved curtain, or want to create a wall of falling water, our designers can create exactly what you desire.</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1c3d71a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="1c3d71a" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-99ad6d7" data-id="99ad6d7" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d5a42c7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="d5a42c7" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
															<img decoding="async" width="750" height="1000" src="/wp-content/uploads/Rain-Curtain-at-Santa-Ana-Star-Casino-Hotel-4-jpg.avif" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-98739" alt="Rain Curtain at Santa Ana Star Casino Hotel 4 jpg" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Rain-Curtain-at-Santa-Ana-Star-Casino-Hotel-4-jpg-100x100.avif 100w, /wp-content/uploads/Rain-Curtain-at-Santa-Ana-Star-Casino-Hotel-4-300x400.avif 300w, /wp-content/uploads/Rain-Curtain-at-Santa-Ana-Star-Casino-Hotel-4-576x768.jpg 576w, /wp-content/uploads/Rain-Curtain-at-Santa-Ana-Star-Casino-Hotel-4-600x800.avif 600w, /wp-content/uploads/Rain-Curtain-at-Santa-Ana-Star-Casino-Hotel-4-jpg.avif 750w" sizes="(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px" title="Rain Curtains 1">															</div>
