				<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f8bf28b" data-id="f8bf28b" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-efd84ee elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="efd84ee" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<h2>Our Process</h2><p>When choosing Midwest Tropical for your rain curtain design, you will receive custom service from start to finish.Your final design will be as unique as your facility and business. Since we manufacture our water features on site in our state-of-the-art facility in the Chicago area,we know that we offer the finest-quality feature available on the market. More than that, we custom create your one-of a kind piece to fit your site. We begin our process by fully understanding your needs and presenting you with options and ideas. We will then explore the type of nozzle and other features you need to complete your design. Once you approve the final design, we will create it. Your final product will be fully customized and built in-house. Then, it will be precisely installed at your facility to ensure optimal function and aesthetics. Our in-house design team offers a turn-key service with products made entirely in the United States, and we can install custom water features built by us in any facility throughout the country.</p><h2>Ideal Settings for Indoor Rain Curtain Water Features</h2><p>The wide appeal of indoor rain curtains makes them ideal for all kinds of settings. Here are a few examples of environments where these water features work well:</p><ul><li>Casinos</li><li>Offices</li><li>Hotels and resorts</li><li>Libraries</li><li>Corporate offices</li><li>Spas and medical offices</li><li>Hospitals</li><li>Restaurants</li><li>Retail stores and shopping centers</li><li>Conference centers</li></ul>								</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2844e77 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="2844e77" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4ad80e4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="4ad80e4" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-08bbf18 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="08bbf18" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<h2><span style="color: var( --e-global-color-secondary ); font-style: inherit; font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; background-color: var(--ast-global-color-5);">Choose Midwest Tropical</span></h2><p>Water features are ambiance-enhancing focal points that can make a space feel more comfortable and inviting. A rain curtain water wall takes that feeling even further, because it adds a sense of mystery and wonder. Embrace the natural beauty of free-flowing water, yet in a controlled package that’s easy to maintain. With a custom feature from Midwest Tropical, your space instantly improves. If you are interested in installing an indoor water curtain in your facility or home, our company is proud to be your No. 1 resource. After all, we invented water curtains. In the decades since, we have fully mastered the process of <a href="/design-process/">designing</a>, creating and installing these features across the globe. To get started <a href="/contact-us-2/">contact us</a> today to request a quote!</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
